The focused alias regression rejects top-level `Run` alongside `run`, aliases alone,
nested replica `Min` alongside `min`, and aliases in the other typed schemas. Dynamic
override identity keys remain case-sensitive and are validated as identities.

Coverage ceiling analysis: 585 statements total, 10 structurally unreachable statements,
98.29% theoretical ceiling; ceiling minus the 2% buffer is 96.29%. Achieved 98.3%.
The residual paths are the `os.Exit` process entrypoint; errors after re-encoding
already-valid JSON / serializing the typed inventory; and defensive JSON subtree/token
errors that cannot occur after the complete document has been validated. Their branches
remain explicit rather than weakening checks to game coverage.

